```css
body {
    font-family: Arial, sans-serif;
    margin: 0;
    background-color: #f8f9fa;
    color: #333;
    line-height: 1.6;
}

header {
    background-color: #2e7d32;
    color: white;
    text-align: center;
    padding: 60px 20px;
}

header h1 {
    margin: 0;
    font-size: 3rem;
}

header p {
    font-size: 1.2rem;
}

nav {
    background-color: white;
    text-align: center;
    padding: 15px;
    position: sticky;
    top: 0;
    border-bottom: 1px solid #ddd;
}

nav a {
    text-decoration: none;
    color: #2e7d32;
    margin: 0 15px;
    font-weight: bold;
}

nav a:hover {
    color: #1b5e20;
}

section {
    max-width: 1000px;
    margin: 40px auto;
    padding: 30px;
    background-color: white;
    border-radius: 10px;
    box-shadow: 0 2px 8px rgba(0,0,0,0.1);
}

h2 {
    color: #2e7d32;
    border-bottom: 2px solid #2e7d32;
    padding-bottom: 10px;
}

h3 {
    color: #444;
}

img {
    max-width: 100%;
    display: block;
    margin: 20px auto;
    border-radius: 8px;
}

ul {
    line-height: 2;
}

footer {
    background-color: #2e7d32;
    color: white;
    text-align: center;
    padding: 20px;
    margin-top: 40px;
}
```
